<div id="pfa" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="a"><div class="pc pca w0 h0"><img class="bi x3 yfc w3 h1e" alt="" src="bga.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">2<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _12"> </span>物理层<span class="_ _2d"> </span><span class="ff3">2.5<span class="_ _12"> </span></span>信道的极限容量</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y7e ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">2.5<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">信道的极限容量</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 yfd ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">信道的传输能力受带宽和噪声的限制，根据信道是否有噪声，分为奈奎斯特准则和香农公式两种计算方法。</div><div class="t m0 x1d h7 yfe ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">奈奎斯特<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Nyquist)<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>准则—<span class="_ _4"></span>—无噪声信道</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yff ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="ff4">：在理想低通（无噪声）信道中，为了避免码间串扰，码元的传输速率是有上限的。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y100 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">适用条件<span class="ff4">：理想无噪声信道。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y101 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">计算<span class="ff4">：极限数据传输速率<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐶</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x48 h17 y102 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑚 𝑎<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑥</div><div class="t m0 x49 h7 y101 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">为：</div><div class="t m0 x4a h18 y103 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝐶</div><div class="t m0 x4b h17 y104 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑚 𝑎<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑥</div><div class="t m0 x4c h8 y103 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">2<span class="_ _3"></span><span class="ff8">𝑊<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffb">log</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x3c h1b y105 ffb fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2</div><div class="t m0 x40 h1a y103 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑉<span class="_ _1f"> </span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff3">bit/s</span>)<span class="_ _30"> </span><span class="ff3">(2.9)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y106 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">参数说明<span class="ff4">：</span></div><div class="t m0 x4d h7 y107 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑊<span class="_ _11"></span><span class="ff4">：信道带宽<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Hz)</span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x4d h7 y108 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑉<span class="_ _11"></span><span class="ff4">：信号状态的级数（即调制技术中每个码元可表示的状态数）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y109 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">结论<span class="ff4">：提高传输速率的方法是增加带宽<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑊<span class="_ _5"> </span></span>或采用更高阶的调制技术（增加<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑉<span class="_ _11"></span></span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h7 y10a ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">香农<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Shannon)<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>公式—<span class="_ _29"></span>—有噪声信道</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y10b ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="ff4">：在带宽受限且有高斯白噪声干扰的信道中，数据传输速率的极限值。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y10c ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">适用条件<span class="ff4">：有高斯白噪声干扰的信道。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y10d ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">计算<span class="ff4">：极限信息传输速率<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐶<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>为：</span></div><div class="t m0 x4 h8 y10e ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝐶<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>𝑊<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffb">log</span></div><div class="t m0 x4e h1b y10f ffb fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2</div><div class="t m0 x39 h1a y10e ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ffb">1<span class="_ _8"> </span></span>+</div><div class="t m0 x4f h18 y110 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑆</div><div class="t m0 x2c h18 y111 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑁</div><div class="t m0 x50 h1a y10e ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">)<span class="_ _a"> </span>(<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff3">bit/s</span>)<span class="_ _31"> </span><span class="ff3">(2.10)</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y112 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">参数说明<span class="ff4">：</span></div><div class="t m0 x4d h7 y113 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑊<span class="_ _11"></span><span class="ff4">：信道带宽<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Hz)</span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x4d h7 y114 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑆<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff4">：信道内所传信号的平均功率。</span></div><div class="t m0 x4d h7 y115 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑁<span class="_ _11"></span><span class="ff4">：信道内部的高斯噪声功率。</span></div><div class="t m0 x4d h7 y116 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑆<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ffa">/<span class="_ _f"></span></span>𝑁<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff4">：信噪比（数值比）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h7 y117 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">信噪比的<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">dB<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>转换（关键考点）</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y118 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">说明<span class="ff4">：题目中通常给出分贝<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(dB)<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>单位的信噪比，在代入香农公式前</span>必须<span class="ff4">先转换为数值比。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y119 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">计算<span class="ff4">：</span></div><div class="t m0 x1b h7 y11a ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">信噪比<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(dB) <span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">10<span class="_ _e"> </span>log</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x3f h1b y11b ffb fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">10</div><div class="t m0 x51 h1f y11c ffe fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"></div><div class="t m0 x52 h18 y11d ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑆</div><div class="t m0 x52 h18 y11e ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑁</div><div class="t m0 x53 h1f y11c ffe fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"></div><div class="t m0 x54 h8 y11a ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(2.11)</div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y11f ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">2.6<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">信道复用技术<span class="_ _5"> </span></span>(Multiple<span class="_ _3"></span>xing)</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y120 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">复用技术允许用户共享信道资源，即在一条传输介质上同时传输多路信号，以提高信道利用率。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y121 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.6.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">频分复用<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>(Frequency<span class="_ _28"> </span>Division<span class="_ _28"> </span>Multiplexing,<span class="_ _28"> </span>FDM)</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y122 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">基本原理<span class="ff4">：将整个传输频带划分为若干个频率范围（子信道）<span class="_ _2"></span>，每个用户占用一个子信道进行通信。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y123 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">特点<span class="ff4">：</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y124 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">所有用户在同样的时间占用不同的带宽资源（频率）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y125 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">各子信道之间通常需要设立“保护频带”<span class="_ _2"></span>，以防止相互干扰。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y126 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">主要用于模拟信号传输（如传统的电话网络、有线电视）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y127 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.6.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">时分复用<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>(Time<span class="_ _28"> </span>Division<span class="_ _28"> </span>Multiplexing,<span class="_ _28"> </span>TDM)</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y128 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">基本原理<span class="ff4">：将时间划分为<span class="_ _f"></span>一段段等长的时分复用帧（<span class="ff3">TDM </span>帧）<span class="_ _33"></span>，每个用户在每个<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff3">TDM<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>帧中占用固定序号</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y129 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">的时隙。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y12a ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">特点<span class="ff4">：</span></div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _25"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">5<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _25"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
